            which runs unchanged on Windows, Linux and MacOS; this
            is the equivalent OLE-only version distributed with
            ooRexx 5.0
   needs:   BSF4ooRexx (ooRexx-Java bridge)
   date:    2022-06-28
   changed: ---
   usage:   rexx swriter_table.rxo
   needs:   ooRexx 5.0 or higher
